	character_poorGuy (Positive): YES! NOW WITH THIS! MINESELF IS...mineself is....what is.....! Happening....!
	Humphrey's head starts to swell
	character_poorGuy (Negative): What have you done!?
	Humphrey's face contorts, a similar face turns it's ugly head at you
	character_poorGuy (Fail): Not again! MINE VISAGE! 
	character_poorGuy (Fail): LOOK AWAY PEASANT! MINE BODY IS NOT FOR THE LIKES OF YOU TO LOOK DOWN UPON!
