	character_poorGuy (Fail): LOOK WHAT YOUR CONCOCTION HAS DONE!
	character_poorGuy (Fail): MINE DIVINE AND HEAVENLY APPEARANCE! RUINED, AGAIN! HOW HUMILIATING!
	character_poorGuy (Fail): TURN MINESELF BACK! RIGHT THIS INSTANT PEASANT! 
